PE 803: Pseudorandom Sequence / 伪随机序列

=== Common PRNG Algorithms ===
1. LCG: x_{n+1} = (a*x_n + c) mod m
2. Middle-square: take middle digits of x_n^2
3. Xorshift: x ^= x<<a; x ^= x>>b; x ^= x<<c
4. Blum Blum Shub: x_{n+1} = x_n^2 mod M
5. Mersenne Twister (MT19937)

